        - Input: :math:`(N, C \times \prod(\text{kernel\_size}), L)` or :math:`(C \times \prod(\text{kernel\_size}), L)`
        - Output: :math:`(N, C, \text{output\_size}[0], \text{output\_size}[1], \dots)`
